umbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/kleptocrats-of-world-unite.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1716116137224879134' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1716116137224879134' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 31, 2009 at 9:23 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3372654087729580178</id><published>2009-01-31T02:17:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-01-31T02:17:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Mr. Grigg, The Kleptocrats are uniting!In Korea th...</title><content type='html'>Mr. Grigg, &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;The Kleptocrats are uniting!&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;In Korea they have arrested Park Dae-Sung, AKA &quot;Minerva,&quot; a blogger who predicted our current economic calamity, and thereby crossed the kleptocrats.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I beg you to research his case and give us your enlightened analysis!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1716116137224879134/comments/default/3372654087729580178'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1716116137224879134/comments/default/3372654087729580178'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/kleptocrats-of-world-unite.html?showComment=1233393420000#c3372654087729580178' title=''/><author><name>Eldon</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/07784189829024952444</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='