.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1716116137224879134' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 30, 2009 at 6:29 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7132731001751557161</id><published>2009-01-30T16:02:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-01-30T16:02:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>As a former resident of Chester,VT I remember when...</title><content type='html'>As a former resident of Chester,VT I remember when that jerk Bremmer came riding into town, fresh from his looting of the Mesopotamia;bought a house smack in the middle of town and proceeded to ingratiate  himself with the natives by participating in all these local charities. What a joke. I found it more than ironic that his little castle was located right adjacent to a funeral home. The soulless living and sleeping next to the house of the dead. How apprapo.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1716116137224879134/comments/default/7132731001751557161'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1716116137224879134/comments/default/7132731001751557161'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/kleptocrats-of-world-unite.html?showComment=1233356520000#c7132731001751557161' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/kleptocrats-of-world-unite.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1716116137224879134' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1716116137224879134' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 30, 2009 at 4:02 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3427594770244692195</id><published>2009-01-29T10:11:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-01-29T10:11:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Why should Geithner have to pay taxes to himself? ...</title><content type='html'>Why should Geithner have to pay taxes to himself? And to answer your question about what they will do after they have sucked us dry, they will move to their armored, paramilitary guarded mansions overseas. They&#39;ll secure these positions while the economy and the dollar still buy stuff.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1716116137224879134/comments/default/3427594770244692195'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1716116137224879134/comments/default/3427594770244692195'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/kleptocrats-of-world-unite.html?showComment=1233249060000#c3427594770244692195' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/kleptocrats-of-world-unite.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1716116137224879134' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1716116137224879134' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 29, 2009 at 10:11 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3216922967582387276</id><published>2009-01-29T06:57:00.000-07:00</p